# Git LFS is intentionally NOT used in this repository.
#
# An early commit (805317cd, 2026-09-16) added an LFS pattern here for
# `Godot_v4.7.2-stable_linux.x86_64`. That binary is gitignored under
# tools/ and was never committed, so no LFS object ever existed -- the
# pattern was inert. It was removed because `git lfs install` writes
# pre-push/post-commit/post-checkout/post-merge hooks that abort EVERY git
# operation when git-lfs is absent from PATH, which breaks `git worktree add`
# (how agent/subagent lanes get their checkout). The engine binary is
# provisioned by scripts/setup-dev.sh, not by LFS.
#
# Do not re-add LFS tracking here without removing the hooks and confirming
# every environment that runs git (CI, agent sandboxes) has git-lfs on PATH.
